	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you become a tactician at level 3, you may choose two of the following martial traditions: Adamant Mountain, Biting Zephyr, Duskwood Sniper, Mirror’s Glint, Sanguine Knot, and Thundering Bombard. You may choose three 1st degree maneuvers from your chosen traditions.</p><p>However, you may only use your tactician maneuvers through your cantrips. To use a ranged maneuver, such as Counter Shot, you must use a cantrip with a ranged spell attack roll, not a saving throw. Similarly, melee maneuvers such as @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-maneuvers.Item.3u54zviexav9aub7]{Lean Into It} require you to use a cantrip with a range of touch or a cantrip which requires a melee weapon as a spell component.</p>",
